{
  "name": "kamikaze",
  "note": [
    "Rig for the depth-7 voxelizer output of the T-pose voxel zombie",
    "(voxel-zombie.rig-source.glb, uncompressed per docs/glb-pipeline.md's",
    "rigging note). Small, slim frame ~1.73 tall in source units, arms",
    "straight out to the sides (T-pose), wearing a bomb vest that bulges",
    "forward off the chest/belly.",
    "Joints read off orthographic renders (front + right, span 2.2) with a",
    "silhouette-boundary scan rather than by eye. The character faces +Z,",
    "so its right hand is on -X and a negative local-X rotation swings a",
    "bone forward.",
    "No overrides are needed — the model has no separate props (no tome,",
    "no held item), so nearest-bone assignment is unambiguous."
  ],
